{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">炎炎夏日想食得惹味一點，不妨跟著肥媽在節目《今個夏天食平D》中示範的「辣味魚頭」食譜大顯身手。這道菜式巧妙地運用了XO醬來烹調魚頭，做法簡單又能輕鬆煮出令人食指大動的佐飯佳餚！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"998c39db-d167-4f0f-8834-bbc14e2b9242.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026dsGAQFJD5L1786699803.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"998c39db-d167-4f0f-8834-bbc14e2b9242.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>準備食材</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">XO醬</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">配料：蔥頭、蒜頭、薑、蔥段</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">調味料：胡椒粉、鹽、紹興酒</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>簡單3步做法</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"d4ba6dac-4992-4976-bd3e-7a8156c03976.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026OCfIolcqLe1786699802.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d4ba6dac-4992-4976-bd3e-7a8156c03976.png.webp\"/><br/> 